{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"farmhouse_t1","model_identifier":"farmhouse_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# farmhouse_t1\n\nFarmhouse tier 1: a low thatched cottage of wattle and daub on a stone footing, where workers shelter at night.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: a stone footing, half-timbered walls with braces, layered thatch with a roped ridge and gable horns, a corbelled chimney, lit green-shuttered windows with flower boxes, a studded door under a porch with a lantern, bench and rain barrel, and a yard with a woodshed, chopping block, herb beds with a bean trellis, bee skeps and hay.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: a stone footing, half-timbered walls with braces, layered thatch with a roped ridge and gable horns, a corbelled chimney, lit green-shuttered windows with flower boxes, a studded door under a porch with a lantern, bench and rain barrel, and a yard with a woodshed, chopping block, herb beds with a bean trellis, bee skeps and hay.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 5 columns (96 x 80 units, 2.70 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -61..40, y 0..119, z -46..46 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 377, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 98 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## Notes\n\n- The thatched eaves are low (51 u); the door rises through a dormer-like daub head to 80 u.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -45)\n- `fx_smoke` at (18, 111, 22)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-33.5, 27, -16)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-33.5, 27, 16)\n- `fx_window_3` at (33.5, 27, -16)\n- `fx_window_4` at (33.5, 27, 16)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-12, 27, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_6` at (12, 27, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_7` at (0, 64, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-22.7, 27, -37.5)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"cobble_found#8a8782","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34,0,-38],"to":[34,3,38],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[207,357,275,360],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[264,354,340,357],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[275,357,343,360],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[340,354,416,357],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[78,91,146,167],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[146,91,214,167],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fbb18d13-fdff-5ca4-bca4-973798e49adf"},{"name":"plaster_w0_n#d8c096","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.1,2.8,-36.1],"to":[32.1,51.1,-31.9],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[354,91,418,139],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[480,174,484,222],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[418,91,482,139],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[484,174,488,222],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,311,64,315],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[64,311,128,315],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"682688bb-3db9-542e-86c6-b5146f5b511c"},{"name":"plaster_w0_s#d8c096","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.1,2.8,31.9],"to":[32.1,51.1,36.1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,174,64,222],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[488,174,492,222],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[64,174,128,222],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[492,174,496,222],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[128,311,192,315],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[192,311,256,315],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1665063a-fdd9-5a91-b36d-4227071cb091"},{"name":"plaster_w0_w#d8c096","