"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":512,"height":512,"uv_width":512,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"c56e8d5c-983e-5c6d-99e8-65972ee79bb8","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# farmhouse_t1\n\nFarmhouse tier 1: a low thatched cottage of wattle and daub on a stone footing, where workers shelter at night.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: a stone footing, half-timbered walls with braces, layered thatch with a roped ridge and gable horns, a corbelled chimney, lit green-shuttered windows with flower boxes, a studded door under a porch with a lantern, bench and rain barrel, and a yard with a woodshed, chopping block, herb beds with a bean trellis, bee skeps and hay.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: a stone footing, half-timbered walls with braces, layered thatch with a roped ridge and gable horns, a corbelled chimney, lit green-shuttered windows with flower boxes, a studded door under a porch with a lantern, bench and rain barrel, and a yard with a woodshed, chopping block, herb beds with a bean trellis, bee skeps and hay.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 5 columns (96 x 80 units, 2.70 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -61..40, y 0..119, z -46..46 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 377, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 98 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## Notes\n\n- The thatched eaves are low (51 u); the door rises through a dormer-like daub head to 80 u.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -45)\n- `fx_smoke` at (18, 111, 22)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-33.5, 27, -16)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-33.5, 27, 16)\n- `fx_window_3` at (33.5, 27, -16)\n- `fx_window_4` at (33.5, 27, 16)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-12, 27, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_6` at (12, 27, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_7` at (0, 64, 37.5)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-22.7, 27, -37.5)"}